daries. To be optimal, all gearing decisions should be made through sims.","url":"https://www.method.gg/guides/feral-druid/stats-races-and-consumables"}],"sources":[{"site":"Icy Veins","what":"talents","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/feral-druid-pve-dps-spec-builds-talents","updated":"2026-10-12T16:30:00+00:00","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:04:23-0700","patch":"12.1.5"},{"site":"Icy Veins","what":"stats","url":"https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/feral-druid-pve-dps-stat-priority","updated":"2026-10-12T16:30:00+00:00","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:04:24-0700","patch":"12.1.5"},{"site":"Wowhead","what":"talents","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/classes/druid/feral/talent-builds-pve-dps","updated":"2026-10-13T16:52:59-05:00","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:04:49-0700","patch":"12.1.5"},{"site":"Wowhead","what":"stats","url":"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/classes/druid/feral/stat-priority-pve-dps","updated":"2026-10-13T16:53:00-05:00","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:04:50-0700","patch":"12.1.5"},{"site":"Method","what":"talents","url":"https://www.method.gg/guides/feral-druid/talents","updated":"13th Oct, 2026","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:04:53-0700","patch":"12.1.5"},{"site":"Method","what":"stats","url":"https://www.method.gg/guides/feral-druid/stats-races-and-consumables","updated":"13th Oct, 2026","fetched":"2026-10-15T09:05:17-0700","patch":"12.1.5"}]}},"switching":[{"text":"Change spec: open Talents (N), pick the Specialization tab, choose Feral or Guardian and click Activate. It is a short cast and only works out of combat.","src":"https://diamondlobby.com/world-of-warcraft/change-specialization-dragonflight/","srcName":"DiamondLobby"},{"text":"Talents can be changed anywhere at no cost, but not in combat, in an active PvP match or an active Mythic+ dungeon. Save each build as a Loadout to swap with one click.","src":"https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/world-of-warcraft/23865972/let-your-new-talents-shine-in-dragonflight","srcName":"Blizzard talents article (Dragonflight-era system, still in use)"},{"text":"The game lets you tie one equipment set to each specialization (Character > Equipment Manager), so swapping spec can swap gear too.","src":"https://www.curseforge.com/wow/addons/rocketswap","srcName":"CurseForge: RocketSwap description"},{"text":"Both specs wear the same Agility leather, so one gear set works for both. Secondary priorities differ: Guardian's first secondary is Haste (Icy Veins, Survivability); Feral's is Mastery (Icy Veins, Single-Target Stat Priority).","src":null},{"text":"Hero trees in the builds above: Guardian — Druid of the Claw, Elune's Chosen; Feral — Druid of the Claw, Wildstalker. Druid of the Claw is available to both specs.","src":null}]}